1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,680
Man: Christy, hey I'm glad I bumped into you

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:08,336
I'm starting a side hustle with a couple of friends.

3
00:00:08,336 --> 00:00:14,040
We're going to do lawn care in the local neighborhoods around our campus.

4
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:17,020
Woman: Oh wow, that sounds like a great idea.

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:20,000
Man: We were wondering if you'd like to join us.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,110
Woman: Doing what, though? I don't have much experience with lawn mowers.

7
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:27,378
Man: That's okay, it doesn't have to be mowing.

8
00:00:27,378 --> 00:00:32,099
You could keep the books or make appointments. We're open to different options.

9
00:00:32,099 --> 00:00:39,070
Woman: I'm on my way to class now, but I'll call you this afternoon.
